            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"The purpose of the digital compilation is to allow the user to construct maps of the Gulf Coast Region using several data sets such as oil and gas plays, the degree of exploration within each play (cell map), the location and extent of Federal lands compared to the oil and gas plays, and a comparison of oil and gas plays with a simplified version of the land use-land cover information.\"",
